OL,3,GNEWSAStill no twin for town two years  
OL,4,Ainto search                            
OL,6,FAn industrial town famed for building  
OL,7,Fwarships and nuclear submarines is     
OL,8,Fstill looking for somewhere to twin    
OL,9,Fwith, two years after it started the   
OL,10,Fsearch.                                
OL,12,FMayor Kay Hyland said, in her opinion, 
OL,13,FBarrow-in-Furness, in Cumbria, was a   
OL,14,F"really, really interesting town".     
OL,16,FBut she said it was discovering that,  
OL,17,Fafter a peak in twinning in the 1980s, 
OL,18,Fmany places in other countries already 
OL,19,Fhad multiple twins and did not want any
OL,20,Fmore.                                  
