OL,3,GNEWSAStill no twin for town two years  
OL,4,Ainto search                            
OL,6,FConversations are now under way with   
OL,7,Fofficials in a town in north-west      
OL,8,FFrance to see if a partnership can be  
OL,9,Fformed.                                
